  "readmeExcerpt": "> [!CAUTION]\n> As of this writing (15 June 2026), we are working to finalise the API and self-hosting documentation over the next few days.\n>\n> We apologise for the brief delay in open-source releases. We paused after spam waves created safety concerns while we built out Fluxer's trust and safety infrastructure. During that same stretch, we have been fixing hundreds of bugs, adding new features, and preparing a much improved audio and video system.\n>\n> You can already try that work in the Fluxer Canary client: [download Canary](https://canary.fluxer.app/download) or [open Canary on the web](https://web.canary.fluxer.app). The latest stable client remains out of date for now, but over the coming weeks we are finalising the remaining work needed to stabilise the current latest code out in the open.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Learn about the developer behind Fluxer, the goals of the project, the tech stack, and what's coming next.\n>\n> [Read the launch blog post](https://blog.fluxer.app/how-i-built-fluxer-a-discord-like-chat-app/) | [View full roadmap](https://blog.fluxer.app/roadmap-2026/)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"./fluxer_static/marketing/branding/logo-white.svg\">\n    <img src=\"./fluxer_static/marketing/branding/logo-color.svg\" alt=\"Fluxer logo\" width=\"400\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://fluxer.app/donate\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-fluxer.app%2Fdonate-brightgreen\" alt=\"Donate\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://docs.fluxer.app\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Docs-docs.fluxer.app-blue\" alt=\"Documentation\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"./LICENSE\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-AGPLv3-purple\" alt=\"AGPLv3 License\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n# Fluxer\n\nFluxer is a free and open source instant messaging and VoIP chat app built for friends, groups, and communities.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"./fluxer_static/marketing/screenshots/desktop-1920w.png\" alt=\"Fluxer app showcase\" width=\"900\">\n</p>\n",
  "readmeHtml": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-caution\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-stop mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.47.22A.749.749 0 0 1 5 0h6c.199 0 .389.079.53.22l4.25 4.25c.141.14.22.331.22.53v6a.749.749 0 0 1-.22.53l-4.25 4.25A.749.749 0 0 1 11 16H5a.749.749 0 0 1-.53-.22L.22 11.53A.749.749 0 0 1 0 11V5c0-.199.079-.389.22-.53Zm.84 1.28L1.5 5.31v5.38l3.81 3.81h5.38l3.81-3.81V5.31L10.69 1.5ZM8 4a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 8 4Zm0 8a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Caution</p><p dir=\"auto\">As of this writing (15 June 2026), we are working to finalise the API and self-hosting documentation over the next few days.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We apologise for the brief delay in open-source releases. We paused after spam waves created safety concerns while we built out Fluxer's trust and safety infrastructure. During that same stretch, we have been fixing hundreds of bugs, adding new features, and preparing a much improved audio and video system.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You can already try that work in the Fluxer Canary client: <a href=\"https://canary.fluxer.app/download\" rel=\"nofollow\">download Canary</a> or <a href=\"https://web.canary.fluxer.app\" rel=\"nofollow\">open Canary on the web</a>. The latest stable client remains out of date for now, but over the coming weeks we are finalising the remaining work needed to stabilise the current latest code out in the open.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\">Learn about the developer behind Fluxer, the goals of the project, the tech stack, and what's coming next.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://blog.fluxer.app/how-i-built-fluxer-a-discord-like-chat-app/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Read the launch blog post</a> | <a href=\"https://blog.fluxer.app/roadmap-2026/\" rel=\"nofollow\">View full roadmap</a></p>\n</div>\n<p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"./fluxer_static/marketing/branding/logo-white.svg\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fluxerapp/fluxer/main/fluxer_static/marketing/branding/logo-color.svg\" alt=\"Fluxer logo\" width=\"400\">\n  </picture></themed-picture>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://fluxer.app/donate\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/17d398b04050413522842ccb0ad7cf4ea883f54bf3936c4d38a4ee4493777d50/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f446f6e6174652d666c757865722e617070253246646f6e6174652d627269676874677265656e\" alt=\"Donate\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Donate-fluxer.app%2Fdonate-brightgreen\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://docs.fluxer.app\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e49d4cfb48b080152ac8810933e81685883710d2c58c923b2856533cd70675f9/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f446f63732d646f63732e666c757865722e6170702d626c7565\" alt=\"Documentation\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Docs-docs.fluxer.app-blue\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fluxerapp/fluxer/blob/main/LICENSE\">\n    <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/f5823fce9f3a473913fbb0396f30c05f1b2a7fc1ce6a1249e711251072799fcd/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f4c6963656e73652d4147504c76332d707572706c65\" alt=\"AGPLv3 License\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-AGPLv3-purple\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Fluxer</h1></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fluxer is a free and open source instant messaging and VoIP chat app built for friends, groups, and communities.</p>\n<p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://github.com/fluxerapp/fluxer/blob/main/fluxer_static/marketing/screenshots/desktop-1920w.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fluxerapp/fluxer/main/fluxer_static/marketing/screenshots/desktop-1920w.png\" alt=\"Fluxer app showcase\" width=\"900\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n</p>\n</article></div>",
